    "# 02 - 语雀 CRUD 完整验证测试\n",
    "\n",
    "> 目标：验证语雀内部 Web API 的 CREATE → READ → UPDATE → READ → DELETE 完整流程。\n",
    "> 重点：每次写入后都立即读取验证，确保内容正确保存。\n",
    "> 测试内容：普通文本、标题、列表、加粗斜体、表格、代码块、公式、引用块。\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 前置准备"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "# 环境准备\n",
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# 加载 .env\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "    load_dotenv(Path('../../.env'))\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    pass\n",
    "\n",
    "SESSION = os.getenv('YUQUE_SESSION') or '你的_yuque_session'\n",
    "CTOKEN  = os.getenv('YUQUE_CTOKEN')  or '你的_ctoken'\n",
    "\n",
    "BASE = 'https://www.yuque.com'\n",
    "COOKIE = f'_yuque_session={SESSION}; _ctoken={CTOKEN}'\n",
    "\n",
    "def build_headers(referer=None):\n",
    "    h = {\n",
    "        'Cookie': COOKIE,\n",
    "        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36',\n",
    "        'Accept': 'application/json, text/plain, */*',\n",
    "        'X-CSRF-Token': CTOKEN,\n",
    "        'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest',\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    if referer:\n",
    "        h['Referer'] = referer\n",
    "    return h\n",
    "\n",
    "def api(method, path, data=None, query=None, referer=None):\n",
    "    url = f'{BASE}{path}'\n",
    "    if query:\n",
    "        url += '?' + '&'.join(f'{k}={v}' for k, v in query.items())\n",
    "    h = build_headers(referer)\n",
    "    if data and method not in ('GET', 'DELETE'):\n",
    "        h['Content-Type'] = 'application/json'\n",
    "    if method == 'GET':\n",
    "        r = requests.get(url, headers=h)\n",
    "    elif method == 'POST':\n",
    "        r = requests.post(url, headers=h, json=data)\n",
    "    elif method == 'PUT':\n",
    "        r = requests.put(url, headers=h, json=data)\n",
    "    elif method == 'DELETE':\n",
    "        r = requests.delete(url, headers=h)\n",
    "    return r.json()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 选一个测试用的知识库\n",
    "r = api('GET', '/api/books')\n",
    "books = r.get('data', [])\n",
    "if not books:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError('未找到知识库，请检查 Cookie')\n",
    "\n",
    "BOOK_ID = books[0]['id']\n",
    "BOOK_SLUG = books[0]['slug']\n",
    "print(f'✅ 使用知识库: {books[0][\"name\"]} (ID={BOOK_ID}, Slug={BOOK_SLUG})')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 全局变量：记录测试创建的文档，用于最后清理\n",
    "TEST_DOCS_TO_CLEANUP = []"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 第1轮：极简格式测试（确认基础 CRUD 可用）\n",
    "\n",
    "先只用最简单的 HTML（h1 + p），验证创建后内容能正确保存。\n",
    "\n",
    "**如果这一轮失败，说明 API 调用本身有问题，不需要继续测复杂格式。**"
   ]
  },
