    "\n",
    "## 附录：Lake HTML 格式总结（基于实测）\n",
    "\n",
    "### 基础结构\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<!doctype lake>\n",
    "<meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" />\n",
    "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" />\n",
    "<meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" />\n",
    "<meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" />\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 标题\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<h1>一级标题</h1>\n",
    "<h2>二级标题</h2>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 段落\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<p>普通段落文字。</p>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 列表\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<ul><li>无序项1</li><li>无序项2</li></ul>\n",
    "<ol><li>有序项1</li><li>有序项2</li></ol>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 表格\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<table class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 600px\">\n",
    "  <colgroup><col width=\"200\"><col width=\"200\"><col width=\"200\"></colgroup>\n",
    "  <tbody>\n",
    "    <tr>\n",
    "      <td><p><span>单元格1</span></p></td>\n",
    "      <td><p><span>单元格2</span></p></td>\n",
    "    </tr>\n",
    "  </tbody>\n",
    "</table>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 代码块\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">def hello():\n",
    "    print('world')\n",
    "</code></pre>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 行内格式\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">加粗</span>\n",
    "<span style=\"font-style: italic\">斜体</span>\n",
    "<code>inline code</code>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 公式\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<span data-latex=\"E = mc^2\">$$E = mc^2$$</span>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 引用\n",
    "```html\n",
    "<blockquote><p><span>引用内容</span></p></blockquote>\n",
    "```"
